..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : SPEDWHG.SE.FO
.. Author         : calbayrak
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Functionality  : set default settings on screen enter event 
...Includes        
..   include  vk/SPEDWHG.SE.A4.FO
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..<META M|='vk/SPEDWHG' >
..
..<BLOCK> Default settings
.copy M|kballeformate = G|false
.copy M|kbdmcdrucken  = G|true
.copy M|kbkompakt  = G|true
.copy M|kbpastnrsort = G|true
..</BLOCK>
..
..<BLOCK> set paper format in customizeable fo program*************************
.. to replace the default setting A4=false, put a file with same name
.. in a directory with higher priority than vk
.input "SPEDWHG.SE.A4.FO"
..</BLOCK>
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue

